# Indenting a project under another in the outline pane updates the breadcrumbs of its tasks in the Today pane at once.
file <<END
Work:
	- Ship it
Launch:
	- Write post @due({today})
END
keys <C-w> s gt
see - Write post  Launch
keys g1 G k <Tab>
see - Write post  Work › Launch
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Ship it
	Launch:
		- Write post @due({today})
END
